UID:example-trip-en-2027-01-04@centenarianos.com
DTSTAMP:20261005T000000Z
DTSTART:20270105T073000
DTEND:20270105T081500
SUMMARY:Example: To the trailhead #trip 7.8mi mode:bike
DESCRIPTION:Example: Trip (English). A trip needs a distance in mi or km (k
 m is converted to miles). mode: is optional\; without it a word like Drive
  or bici in the title counts. Delete this event when you are done testing.
LOCATION:Riverside Trailhead
END:VEVENT
